					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Rarius, cum rariores contingunt nuncii, sc<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ribo, nunc, cum frequentiores habeam, frequentius etiam scribo; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tu boni semper meam consules importunitatem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName ref="p1049">Farellus</persName> et hic frater afferant, audies ex ipsis; senatus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>noster bene affectus est hac in re, et si vestri volent, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non gravabuntur nostri, quantum suspicor, denuo legationem <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mittere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cognoscam tamen ex te, quid vestris videatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Hic, qui has affert, voluit, ut senatus promitteret <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>legatum; sed nostri sine reliquis urbibus nihil <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>agent.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p20206">Gribaldus</persName> hodie erroribus suis abrenunciavit <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et confessioni nostrae subscripsit; eam sua manu <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>describet et hic relinquet.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scribetur hoc etiam ad principem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l572">Wirtembergensem</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Hoc ubi factum fuerit, relegabitur <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>etiam extra fines ditionis huius.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Haec de ill..</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Decades <persName ref="p4191">Apiarius</persName> imprimere cepit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ego exemplum, quod <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>iam diu non habui mecum, relego prius, ut emendatius <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>exeat; offendo quaedam, in quibus me iuvare non <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>gravaberis, oro.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sermone 9. mox post initium <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>in testimonio <persName ref="p18988">Cypriani</persName> scribitur: "Ne autem in illis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quidem vocabulis, ubi de divinitate fidei ordinatur" <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sic habet exemplar <placeName ref="l378">Pari(si)ense</placeName> atque etiam <placeName ref="l28">Basiliense</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tuque sic quoque descripsisse videris, cum tamen contextum le<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>genti omnino hae duę voces "ne autem" abundare <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>videntur, et sic contextus erit planus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Idem videtur <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculo</persName>; volo tamen ex te quoque audire, quid sentias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Haec nunc festinanter; ubi plura invenero, scribam, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ut me expedias.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>20 septembris 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię pastori fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et compatri suo charissimo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>colendissimoque.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>